{
  "id": "section-818",
  "title": "对共青团中央的批评",
  "level": 0,
  "sourceUrl": "https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/5-198.htm",
  "html": "<table><tbody><tr><td> -&gt;  -&gt; <a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/index.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">1968年汉版《毛泽东思想万岁》</a><hr>\n<b>198)</b>\n\n\n<br>\n<br>\n　　有人讲团中央“三胡”糊里糊涂。明明白白站在资产阶级方面，什么糊里糊涂？团中央不但不支持学生群众运动，反而镇压学生群众运动，应严格处理。<br><br><hr><p><a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/5-197.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">上一页</a>　<a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/index.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">目录</a>　<a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/5-199.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">下一页</a><br><br></p></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n"
}
